## Architecture at a Glance

```
src/
├── core/              # Interfaces, errors, services
├── providers/         # YouTube, Facebook, TikTok, Instagram
│   └── youtube/       # Each provider is independent
├── api/               # Express routes & middleware
├── database/          # In-memory (ready for PostgreSQL)
├── websocket/         # Real-time chat server
└── __tests__/         # Jest unit + Playwright integration
```

## Key Principles

1. **Modular**: Each platform provider is completely independent
2. **Interface-driven**: All providers implement `StreamProvider`
3. **Graceful degradation**: Continue working if platforms fail
4. **Type-safe**: TypeScript strict mode, no `any`
5. **Tested**: Unit + integration tests required

